{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Pre-implementation measurement at origin/main ce5795c6a5c. The 39-pair count is exact. One correction to the Approach's enumeration, recorded as a comment rather than a description edit so the certification and the parent epic's pin both survive.\n\n**The Approach lists 12 definition renames; 13 are required.** Comparing every shared definition body across all 39 pairs (AST, md5 of the source span) gives 33 identical and 14 differing. One of the 14 is the test function `test_unreadable_optional_config_warns_structurally_and_returns_false` in `test_plan_material_pin_config.py`, which is the whole-file-deletion case the Approach already carves out. That leaves **13 helper/fixture renames, not 12**.\n\nThe missing one is **`store` in `tests/unit/test_identity_ts2_09f9.py`**. The enumeration names `_head` from that file but not `store`; both differ between base and twin.\n\nIt matters more than an off-by-one because `store` is a **pytest fixture**, which is the hazard ADVI4 raised. Concatenating two differing `store` fixtures into one module leaves the second shadowing the first, so base tests requesting `store` silently bind the held-out body. No error, no collection failure — a green run asserting against the wrong fixture.\n\nRelated: ADVI4 counts 4 fixtures among the differing definitions. Measured, there are **5** — `clean_registry` (test_attest_registry.py) and `store` in test_audit_serve.py, test_identity_3183.py, test_identity_4e9d.py and test_identity_ts2_09f9.py. The fifth is the same one the enumeration drops.\n\nNo AC pins the number 12; it appears only in the Approach prose. The Approach's rename *rule* (\"rename differing definitions and repoint their callers\"; \"suffix the HELD-OUT definition `_heldout`\") covers all 13, and AC2's unchanged per-file node counts plus `make verify` are what actually verify the merge. Implementation will apply all 13 under the stated rule."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793481600263893001,"uuid":"1a6ba396-7d82-44c4-b2f8-db48c7e0f76d"}